#N canvas 0 0 1200 900 10;
#X text 20 10 SERENITY -- ambient random generator (vanilla Pd);
#X text 20 28 pentatonic pad chord w/ slow LFO swells + wandering root\, random FM chime scheduler\, feedback-delay space.;
